If you want your hate crimes, you can keep your hate crimes...more race baiting we can believe in:  

@KoolkidsKlanKkk, reportedly sent out a tweet that read, “We’re planning to attack tomorrow”....and you'll never guess who was behind the "KKK attack" on the mostly black student body...wait...for....it......a 14-year-old African American female who attends Arundel High School.

http://baltimore.cbslocal.com/2017/01/11/police-cite-student-for-threat-made-at-arundel-high-school/

Well, Monsignor Pope has just re-written church and sacrament history.  He either is ignorant or believes in his own version of church history that more clearly can be described as a version of the catholic *flat earth* society.
